e tickets and the hotel:\n\n$$\n\\text{Total cost} = 10000 + 5400 = \\boxed{15400}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 **Final Answer:**\n\n$$\n\\boxed{15400}\n$$", "decode_seconds": 8.944234511815012, "draft_calls": 0, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 97, "method": "native_ar", "output_hash": "94913e316669d3cc4e1ced7794e4817e74382ad07d89868e8cc6efc860f668b4", "output_tokens": 339, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 20520671744, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 20843593728, "problem_id": "gsm8k/051ae2b51a5de494", "profile_regions_ms": {"unattributed_runtime": 8978.676277212799}, "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "15400", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 8.978676277212799, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 20843593728, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 20843593728, "sampling_seed": 6559189779409587168, "sampling_temperature": 0.6, "target_calls": 339, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.03284740727394819, "turn_index": 0}
